                  <annotatedElement xmi:idref="CDIFDataStructure.PrimaryKey"/>
                  <body>Role of an ordered set of cdi:InstanceVariables that uniquely identify each data instance. Position is implicit in cdif:isComposedOf array order.</body>
               </ownedComment>
